<title>USA: GOLF-U.S. RYDER CUP TEAM STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-U.S. RYDER CUP TEAM STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Florida 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Ryder</p>
<p>Cup team standings leaders as issued by the PGA of America on</p>
<p>Monday:</p>
<p>  1. Tom Lehman		  1016.286 points</p>
<p>  2. Tiger Woods		 1015.000</p>
<p>  3. Mark O'Meara		 801.250</p>
<p>  4. Brad Faxon		   727.500</p>
<p>  5. Scott Hoch		   711.946</p>
<p>  6. Tommy Tolles		 689.285</p>
<p>  7. Phil Mickelson	     659.286</p>
<p>  8. Jim Furyk		    647.500</p>
<p>  9. Davis Love		   638.500</p>
<p> 10. Steve Jones		  579.280</p>
<p> 11. Jeff Maggert		 566.625</p>
<p> 12. Mark Brooks		  549.750</p>
<p> 13. Paul Stankowski	    503.334</p>
<p> 14. Justin Leonard	     473.500</p>
<p> 15. David Duval		  470.000</p>
<p>Note: The top 10 following the PGA Championship in August</p>
<p>automatically qualify for the 12-man U.S. team to play the</p>
<p>32nd Ryder Cup against Europe September 26-28 at Valderrama in</p>
<p>Sotogrande, Spain</p>
